  "changelog": "tech-evolution-analysis 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release featuring a 7-step analytical pipeline for product technology evolution, based on TRIZ 11 evolution paths, SVOP functional abstraction, and four-track (patent/paper, in-domain/cross-domain) retrieval.\n- Supports structured system decomposition, high-value filtering, TRIZ-based mapping, evolution forest visualization, and 3/5/10 year future predictions, including \"gray rhino\" and \"black swan\" event classification.\n- Standardized intermediate and final outputs (including diagrams and McKinsey-style report) with reusable asset templates.\n- Requires integration with PatSnap MCP service for live data; provides methodological framework if unconfigured.\n- Detailed trigger scenarios and step-by-step user confirmation workflow included.",
